Description: A client for 'HL7 FHIR' R4 servers (search with automatic
    paging, read, create, update, delete, transactions and the '$everything',
    '$validate' and bulk data '$export' operations, with 'SMART on FHIR'
    'OAuth2' authentication) and an engine that turns FHIR resources into
    tables following the 'SQL on FHIR' 'ViewDefinition' specification
    <https://sql-on-fhir.org/>. 'FHIRPath' expressions are evaluated with
    the 'fhirpath.js' library through the 'V8' package; an experimental
    second engine translates views to 'DuckDB' SQL to process millions of
    resources from 'NDJSON' or 'Parquet' files. Includes the official 'SQL on
    FHIR' conformance test suite, export of views to 'DuckDB', and
    integration with the 'RStudio' Connections pane and addins.
    Documentation is in Spanish.
